                        "entry_id": "69d2a38d-c364-3e46-b21f-2575e71ec266",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The grandmother of Timothy who is mentioned in an epistle to him."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "13c0c3a3-92c8-47b1-a6f7-b7d9037a3f8f",
                                "sense_id": "469353ec-19eb-339b-b0ff-a25f3b5c6b94",
                                "text": "When I call to remembrance the unfeigned faith that is in thee, which dwelt first in thy grandmother Lois, and thy mother Eunice; and I am persuaded that in thee also."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "99cc187b-63d8-36f0-b714-1d5fa75f9bcb",
                        "entry_id": "69d2a38d-c364-3e46-b21f-2575e71ec266",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A female given name from Ancient Greek of biblical origin."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
