                                "sense_id": "99cc187b-63d8-36f0-b714-1d5fa75f9bcb",
                                "text": "Modernity might also lie in a name like Lois - pronounced Loys in Trinidad - which came to the island in the 1940s through Lois Lane, the heroine of the American Superman comic strip."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
